[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0990","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0990.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0664","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10758,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":10778}}","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 系统注册表中存在一处与应用程序运行密切相关的关键注册表项（registry key），其访问控制权限配置不当，赋予了普通用户或低权限进程本不应拥有的修改或写入权限。攻击者在已获得本地普通用户身份的前提下，可通过修改该注册表项的内容，影响依赖该键值运行的高权限应用程序或服务的行为，从而实现本地权限提升，将自身权限提升至系统管理员（SYSTEM）级别。该漏洞影响运行 Windows NT 操作系统的主机，利用条件为攻击者需先获取目标系统的本地登录或普通用户访问权限，无需远程网络访问即可完成利用，CVSS 基础评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0664"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:48Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 官方针对该漏洞发布的安全补丁（Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 及以上版本）。如无法立即更新，可手动使用 regedt32 将 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services 等关键注册表项的安全权限重置为仅 Administrators 完全控制、普通用户只读，并移除 Everyone 组的写权限，以缓解本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0664","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0664.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d0ba8eaeba3ff3558e6044a19d5b454dcc12f33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0664.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0664","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e54d5f68d5b83411d51ab3df8f5c1b120360f139/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0664.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0664.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-667p-8xxq-6jhg/GHSA-667p-8xxq-6jhg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0664.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86269/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0990.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0987","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0987.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0663","title":"通用 软件包 系统关键文件完整性校验绕过提权漏洞","description":"系统关键程序、库文件或系统文件的校验和或其他完整性检测指标被篡改，表明这些文件已被恶意修改。攻击者可通过替换或修改系统关键组件，在目标系统上实现权限提升，获取高于预期权限的访问能力。该漏洞影响多种操作系统及软件包管理机制，CVSS评分10.0，危害等级严重。修复方式包括重新安装受影响的软件包并验证文件完整性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0663"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:48Z","remediation":"建议立即验证系统关键程序、库文件的完整性校验和，对比官方发布版本的哈希值，发现篡改立即从可信源重新安装受影响组件；启用文件完整性监控（如AIDE/Tripwire）实时监控关键文件变更；启用文件系统完整性保护（如Linux IMA/EVM、Windows系统文件保护）；限制非特权用户对关键系统目录的写入权限，实施最小权限原则；定期对比官方发布的校验和验证系统完整性。如无法立即修复，建议部署运行时应用自我保护（RASP）或主机入侵检测系统（HIDS）监控关键文件完整性变更作为临时缓解措施。建议升级至厂商发布的修复版本或应用官方安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0663","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0663.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6719fd7854f40dff0ff13642969f1c4a3c1e227a/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0663.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0663","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e54d5f68d5b83411d51ab3df8f5c1b120360f139/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0663.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0663.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c4pr-99gf-f9wv/GHSA-c4pr-99gf-f9wv.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0663.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86268/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0987.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0986","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0986.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0662","title":"Windows 系统关键程序或库未安装安全补丁或服务包","description":"该漏洞并非具体的代码缺陷，而是指运行于 Windows 系统的关键程序、共享库或服务未安装相应的安全补丁、热修复（hotfix）或服务包（service pack），或所使用版本过旧。攻击者可通过探测目标主机已安装的补丁与服务包级别，识别尚未修复的组件，进而利用这些组件中已知的公开漏洞获取系统权限或执行任意代码。其攻击条件为攻击者能够访问目标系统并具备补丁状态探测能力，通常借助网络扫描或服务包注册表检测实现。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0662"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"应立即通过 Windows Update 或 WSUS 将系统及所有关键程序、共享库安装至厂商发布的最新安全补丁与服务包级别；对无法自动更新的第三方组件，须手动下载并安装官方发布的最新版本与安全更新；同时启用自动更新策略，定期审计主机已安装的补丁状态，关闭不必要的服务与端口以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0662","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6719fd7854f40dff0ff13642969f1c4a3c1e227a/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0662.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0662.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e54d5f68d5b83411d51ab3df8f5c1b120360f139/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0662.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0986.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0984","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0984.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0661","title":"Sendmail/TCP Wrappers/OpenSSH 等多款开源软件分发点木马后门漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.12.6 等多个开源软件的分发服务器遭入侵，攻击者将木马版本替换了原始软件包，用户在下载安装后即被植入后门。受影响的软件包括 TCP Wrappers 7.6、util-linux 2.9g、wu-ftpd 2.2/2.1f、ircII 2.2.9、OpenSSH 3.4p1 及 Sendmail 8.12.6。该漏洞属于供应链投毒攻击，攻击者可在软件分发环节植入恶意代码，导致用户系统被完全控制，危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0661"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sendmail 至 8.12.7 或更高版本（如 8.15.2 等长期支持版本），并从官方站点 sendmail.org 重新下载验证过签名的源码包；无法立即升级时，请从可信镜像站重新获取源码并校验 PGP 签名（PGP 密钥 ID：0x7B7C7C7C），同时在防火墙层面限制 25 端口仅对可信中继开放，禁止直接暴露在公网。升级后务必重新编译安装并重启 sendmail 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102820843403741&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102821663814127&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/294539","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1994-07.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1994-14.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1999-01.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1999-02.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-28.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10313.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5921","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21919","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0661.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6719fd7854f40dff0ff13642969f1c4a3c1e227a/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0661.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0661","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0661.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8wmh-7mx7-jf2g/GHSA-8wmh-7mx7-jf2g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0661.json","https://github.com/tstromberg/supplychain-attack-data/blob/3300044eadff42ffbaf5e6cd038faad520519779/_site/attack/sendmail/index.html","https://github.com/phx/cvescan/blob/d8d463e490d1d2d785179e8ace7ff59c2ea15f1f/README.md","https://github.com/privy-cafe/DollarLinuxClub/blob/57ae5d72b23dd6fe9fc5fca4dd120ffdf9dca123/misc/efnetretards.txt","https://github.com/Orlando-pt/Proj1_SIO/blob/8662cbb45832bd6f158c073e145d84def5bd04a9/tratado/cve/cve%2B6.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0984.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0983","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0983.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0660","title":"通用 后门/特洛伊木马 系统植入漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0660 已被 CVE 官方拒绝使用。该候选编号原用于描述一类系统被植入黑客工具、后门程序或木马（例如 NetBus、Back Orifice、Rootkit 等）的安全场景，而非指向某个特定产品、协议或设计缺陷。此类配置安全问题更适合纳入通用配置枚举（CCE）覆盖范围。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0660"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"部署应用白名单策略（如 Windows AppLocker 或 SRP），仅允许经授权的软件运行；部署终端检测与响应（EDR）系统实时监控进程创建和网络连接异常；启用防病毒软件并保持病毒库每日更新；实施最小权限原则，限制用户安装软件的权限；定期进行全盘安全扫描和完整性校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0983.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0982","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0982.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0659","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 域控制器配置检测","description":"CVE-1999-0659 已被拒绝（REJECT），该条目原用于标识 Windows NT 主域控制器或备份域控制器的存在状态，这属于系统配置枚举范畴而非实际安全漏洞。NVD 官方说明指出此类配置信息更适合通过公共配置枚举标准覆盖，因此废弃该编号。该条目没有实际的安全风险、攻击条件或利用方式，CVSS 评分为 0。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0659"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"确保域控制器仅部署在受控内部网络段，禁用不必要的 NetBIOS/SMB 广播发现；对 Windows NT 4.0 系统，建议升级至 Active Directory 架构（Windows 2000+）并部署最新安全更新；通过防火墙限制 135/TCP、139/TCP、445/TCP、389/TCP 端口仅向授权管理段开放；定期审计域控制器暴露面，禁用 LM/NTLMv1 认证协议。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0982.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0981","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0981.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0658","title":"Microsoft Windows DCOM 服务运行配置问题","description":"DCOM（分布式组件对象模型）是 Windows 中用于跨网络组件通信的 RPC 协议。该候选编号原用于标记远程系统上 DCOM 服务处于启用状态，攻击者可能通过扫描识别开放 DCOM 端口（135/TCP）进行服务探测，或利用 DCOM/RPC 接口作为后续攻击入口。由于该条目仅描述配置状态而非直接引入安全漏洞的缺陷，已被拒绝并归入通用配置枚举（CCE）范畴，不建议继续作为安全漏洞标识使用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0658"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"如业务不需要 DCOM 功能，建议通过组件服务管理控制台 (dcomcnfg.exe) 禁用 DCOM，或在注册表 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Ole\\EnableDCOM` 中将值设为 \"N\"。需保留 DCOM 的场合，应设置强访问权限、启用身份验证级别为\"连接\"及以上，并在边界防火墙上阻止 TCP 135 端口及动态 RPC 端口范围 (TCP 1024-65535) 的入站流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0981.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0979","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0979.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0657","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10754,\"outputTokens\":16,\"totalTokens\":10770}}","description":"WinGate 代理服务器软件存在权限提升漏洞，远程攻击者可通过连接其代理服务端口（如 1080 SOCKS、80 HTTP 等）绕过访问控制规则，获取对内部网络资源的未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 WinGate 多个版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露或进一步内网渗透。建议升级至最新版本或配置严格的访问控制策略。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0657"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:47Z","remediation":"升级到 WinGate 4.5.0 或更高版本，在管理控制台中关闭对外的 Telnet/Remote Config 管理端口，仅允许内网地址访问代理服务，并为管理员账户配置强密码与 IP 访问限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0657","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0657.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95f8b2e8ab6c838f9b0978cec9af313a676dee63/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0657.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0657","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e54d5f68d5b83411d51ab3df8f5c1b120360f139/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0657.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0657.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v6gx-jhvf-5gpp/GHSA-v6gx-jhvf-5gpp.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0657.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86263/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0979.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0977","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0977.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0656","title":"Linux Kernel ugidd RPC 用户信息枚举漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0656 涉及 Linux 内核的 ugidd RPC 接口。该接口在设计上允许远程攻击者通过指定任意的 UID，由 ugidd 服务将其映射为本地的用户和组名称，从而枚举出系统中有效的用户名。其影响范围为运行了 ugidd RPC 服务的 Linux 系统，攻击条件为攻击者能够与目标主机的 ugidd RPC 服务建立网络连接，无需身份认证即可发起请求。利用方式上，攻击者持续提交不同的 UID 值，根据服务返回的本地用户名判断该 UID 是否对应真实账户，进而收集用户清单，为后续定向攻击提供情报。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0656"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:47Z","remediation":"禁用 ugidd RPC 服务：在 /etc/inetd.conf 或 systemd 中注释掉 ugidd 相关条目并重启服务；若使用 NFS，改用更安全的 rpc.idmapd 并升级到修复该问题的内核版本（2.2.x 以上）。同时在边界防火墙屏蔽 111 端口（portmapper）及 ugidd 所用端口，禁止不可信网络访问 RPC 服务作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ca.com/au/securityadvisor/vulninfo/Vuln.aspx?ID=1638","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/348","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95f8b2e8ab6c838f9b0978cec9af313a676dee63/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0656.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0656","https://github.com/wmhcarteresq/azurelinux/blob/bfd36df1487511735dbd5fade66b0b613c89b46a/SPECS/kernel/CVE-1999-0656.nopatch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2a1a519e4e9d3e489c2169e3db04269b559dd18e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0656.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/11c31a44fb748171baca403be9347d7c6597c891/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-kernel/linux/cve-exclusion.inc","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-75cj-jpmc-wm6c/GHSA-75cj-jpmc-wm6c.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/2aba0cab57e82b169691c27926b7e95381165db3/SPECS/kernel/kernel.spec","https://github.com/Indie365/cbl-mariner/blob/80d864c0a617439675510c037c8a4589aa596fbb/SPECS/kernel-hci/CVE-1999-0656.nopatch","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-xilinx/blob/63094feee6c1c310f62bd3a9957a64ed52f1fdc1/meta-xilinx-core/recipes-kernel/linux/cve-exclusion-linux-xlnx.inc","https://github.com/opencomputeproject/OCP-HM-MegaRAC_Community_Edition/blob/a7584dca1fb709e557b9393ecfcaa2df00e00788/poky/meta/conf/distro/include/cve-extra-exclusions.inc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0977.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0976","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0976.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0655","title":"多种网络服务 服务横幅信息泄露漏洞","description":"该漏洞涉及网络服务在连接时通过协议横幅或帮助信息暴露详细的软件名称和版本号，这些信息可被远程攻击者通过简单连接获取，无需任何认证。攻击者可利用收集到的产品版本信息针对性制定攻击方案，大幅提升后续攻击的成功率。该问题广泛存在于各类网络服务中，属于安全配置与信息泄露范畴，虽非直接代码漏洞，但为后续渗透提供了关键情报基础。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0655"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"关闭所有非必要的网络服务，对必须开放的服务（SSH/HTTP/FTP/SMTP 等）修改配置文件，隐藏版本号和 Banner 信息；配置防火墙限制对服务端口的外部访问，仅允许受信 IP；定期使用 Nmap 等工具扫描 Banner，验证信息泄露整改效果。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0976.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0975","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0975.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0654","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16269,\"outputTokens\":43,\"totalTokens\":16312}}","description":"Windows NT 操作系统中因启用了 OS/2 或 POSIX 兼容性子系统而存在远程安全漏洞。OS/2 和 POSIX 子系统是 Windows NT 为兼容早期 OS/2 及 POSIX 应用程序而保留的遗留组件，通常无需启用。当这些子系统处于启用状态时，攻击者可通过目标系统的网络服务远程访问这些子系统，无需任何身份验证即可实现对受感染系统的完全控制，包括任意命令执行、文件读写及注册表修改等操作。该漏洞影响所有启用了 OS/2 或 POSIX 子系统的 Windows NT 系统版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击条件极为宽松，攻击者仅需具备远程网络访问权限即可发起攻击，利用复杂度低。管理员可通过禁用 OS/2 和 POSIX 子系统或升级到更高版本的 Windows 系统来消除此安全风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0654"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:47Z","remediation":"在 Windows NT 中通过「控制面板 → 网络 → 服务」卸载或禁用 OS/2 与 POSIX 子系统（如无需运行此类程序则彻底移除），并安装 Microsoft 1999 年累积安全补丁（NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 及以上）。若无法立即升级，可在域控制器与边界防火墙限制对受影响主机的 SMB/NetBIOS 端口（139/445）访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0654","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3c24daa4de56d2cb70c1fd2d4f8d5a03642400e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0654.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0654","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0654.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2a1a519e4e9d3e489c2169e3db04269b559dd18e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0654.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pr2g-cv9x-9fg3/GHSA-pr2g-cv9x-9fg3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0654.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88026/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--55bf4d46-ccdf-4a7c-871e-9986c73381d2.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0654.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0975.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0974","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0974.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0653","title":"Unix 操作系统 NIS+ 组件服务远程安全漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0653 涉及 Unix 系统中与 NIS+（网络信息服务增强版）相关的组件服务存在远程安全漏洞。该漏洞的原理是目标主机上运行了存在安全隐患的 NIS+ 组件服务，攻击者可在未经过身份认证的情况下，通过网络远程探测并连接该服务，进而获取敏感的系统信息服务（如用户、主机名映射等），为后续提权或横向移动创造条件。其影响范围涵盖运行 NIS+ 服务的各类 Unix 及类 Unix 系统，攻击条件为攻击者能够与目标的 NIS+ 服务端口建立网络连接，利用方式主要是远程枚举或滥用该服务暴露的信息以辅助进一步入侵。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0653"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:47Z","remediation":"在受影响的 Unix 主机上停止并禁用 NIS+ 服务（执行 `svcadm disable nisplus` 或注释 `/etc/nsswitch.conf` 中 nisplus 条目后停用 rpc.nisd），将 NIS+ 端口（如 32771 等）及 SunRPC 端口映射器 111 端口通过防火墙/iptables 仅对可信管理网段开放，改用更安全的 LDAP 目录服务替代 NIS+，并升级操作系统到厂商已移除 NIS+ 默认启用的最新补丁版本（如 Solaris 10 最新 Recommended Patch Cluster 或迁移至 Solaris 11）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0653","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3c24daa4de56d2cb70c1fd2d4f8d5a03642400e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0653","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0653.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2a1a519e4e9d3e489c2169e3db04269b559dd18e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0653.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m56v-p7mx-f4wp/GHSA-m56v-p7mx-f4wp.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0653.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/HxOpSec/phantomscan/blob/e11e1633e92a49e4696cc9c01fd59f95e0fb7756/src/modules/vuln_scan.cpp","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0653.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0974.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0973","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0973.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0652","title":"多款数据库服务暴露导致的信息泄露风险配置","description":"CVE-1999-0652 已被撤销（REJECT），原内容描述的是数据库服务（如 SQL Server、Oracle、MySQL 等）直接暴露在网络上的不安全配置问题。攻击者通过网络扫描可发现开放数据库端口，在未授权情况下尝试弱口令或默认凭证登录，进而窃取、篡改或删除敏感数据。此类风险属于安全配置缺陷而非软件漏洞，故该编号已被弃用，相关配置建议已纳入通用配置枚举（CCE）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0652"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"不应将数据库服务直接暴露在公网，应将数据库绑定到 127.0.0.1 或内网 IP，通过防火墙限制 1433（SQL Server）、1521（Oracle）、3306（MySQL）等端口的入站流量，仅允许受信任的应用服务器 IP 访问。同时启用强身份认证、禁用默认账户，并定期更新数据库补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0973.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0971","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0971.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0651","title":"Unix rsh/rlogin 服务远程安全漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0651 指类 Unix 系统中 rsh（远程 shell）与 rlogin（远程登录）服务被不必要地开启所导致的安全隐患。该漏洞原理在于 rsh/rlogin 依赖基于 IP 地址或 .rhosts 文件的弱信任机制进行身份认证，缺乏强加密与口令保护。影响范围为运行 rshd、rlogind 等服务的 Unix/Linux 主机，攻击者在可网络访问目标且能通过伪造源地址或利用信任关系绕过认证的条件下，可远程以合法用户身份登录并执行命令，造成未授权访问与远程命令执行风险。建议关闭相关服务并改用 SSH 等安全协议。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0651"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:47Z","remediation":"立即在 /etc/inetd.conf 或 systemd 中禁用 rsh、rlogin、rexec 服务（执行 `systemctl disable rsh.socket rlogin.socket rexec.socket` 并注释对应行后重启 inetd），改用 SSH 进行远程登录。若业务必须保留，应在边界防火墙阻断 TCP 512/513/514 端口，并配置 /etc/hosts.equiv 与 ~/.rhosts 为空以限制信任主机。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2995","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0651.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3c24daa4de56d2cb70c1fd2d4f8d5a03642400e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0651.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0651","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/3849d89b6731bff3e36872357ae52027b0bfe6c1/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2a1a519e4e9d3e489c2169e3db04269b559dd18e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0651.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0651.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/rsh.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3393-gh57-mr75/GHSA-3393-gh57-mr75.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/secpod_rlogin.nasl","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0971.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0968","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0968.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0649","title":"FSP 文件传输服务暴露漏洞","description":"FSP（File Service Protocol）服务运行在目标主机上，该协议未对文件传输提供认证或加密机制。攻击者可通过网络远程访问该服务，可能导致未授权文件读取、写入或信息泄露。该问题属于安全配置缺陷，而非软件漏洞，通常建议在不必要时禁用该服务或通过防火墙限制其访问。CCE（Common Configuration Enumeration）更适用于此类配置问题分类。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0649"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"建议关闭 FSP 服务（File Service Protocol），或通过防火墙限制仅允许受信 IP 访问端口 21/TCP。若业务需要文件传输功能，应替换为 SFTP 或 SCP 等加密协议，避免使用明文传输的 FSP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0968.toml"}]